{"4357300": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Sumo Fumble: Physics Party", "steam_appid": 4357300, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the pinnacle of uncoordinated combat. Battle friends and family in physics-driven sumo matches where your greatest enemy isn't the opponent, it’s your own center of gravity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Local Multiplayer:</strong> Up to 4<strong> players</strong> chaotic <strong>Free-for-All</strong> or<strong> Team</strong> <strong>modes</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4357300/extras/4c1716fbe4d9920b07b03b5bcb368d14.poster.avif?t=1780813752\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4357300/extras/4c1716fbe4d9920b07b03b5bcb368d14.webm?t=1780813752\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4357300/extras/4c1716fbe4d9920b07b03b5bcb368d14.mp4?t=1780813752\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Slapstick Physics:</strong> <strong>Push</strong>, <strong>kick</strong>, <strong>grab</strong>, and <strong>hurl</strong> your opponents using unstable physics that turns every fight into a slapstick disaster.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4357300/extras/1fc24ebf08dc282056c85f204182cd2d.poster.avif?t=1780813752\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4357300/extras/1fc24ebf08dc282056c85f204182cd2d.webm?t=1780813752\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4357300/extras/1fc24ebf08dc282056c85f204182cd2d.mp4?t=1780813752\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Win by <strong>any means</strong> necessary.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4357300/extras/356798d24aaabe964b7c1511246b7254.poster.avif?t=1780813752\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4357300/extras/356798d24aaabe964b7c1511246b7254.webm?t=1780813752\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4357300/extras/356798d24aaabe964b7c1511246b7254.mp4?t=1780813752\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hazardous Arena: </strong>Turn the arena into a weapon with interactive, <strong>ridiculous hazards</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4357300/extras/34cf2a47c8a3d14203b98b29b65cf3da.poster.avif?t=1780813752\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4357300/extras/34cf2a47c8a3d14203b98b29b65cf3da.webm?t=1780813752\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4357300/extras/34cf2a47c8a3d14203b98b29b65cf3da.mp4?t=1780813752\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the pinnac