/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Win by <strong>any means</strong> necessary.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4357300/extras/356798d24aaabe964b7c1511246b7254.poster.avif?t=1780813752\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4357300/extras/356798d24aaabe964b7c1511246b7254.webm?t=1780813752\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4357300/extras/356798d24aaabe964b7c1511246b7254.mp4?t=1780813752\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hazardous Arena: </strong>Turn the arena into a weapon with interactive, <strong>ridiculous hazards</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4357300/extras/34cf2a47c8a3d14203b98b29b65cf3da.poster.avif?t=1780813752\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4357300/extras/34cf2a47c8a3d14203b98b29b65cf3da.webm?t=1780813752\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4357300/extras/34cf2a47c8a3d14203b98b29b65cf3da.mp4?t=1780813752\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "Sumo Fumble is a silly physics-based couch party game with procedurally self-balancing characters. Grab, heave, and throw your rivals into wild hazards, or pull their pants off for a laugh. Fumble, flail, and fall your way to victory in ever-changing arenas!", "supported_languages": "English, Indonesi